dBASE III PLUS COMMAND REFERENCE
================================

COMMON SCOPE MODIFIERS
----------------------

ALL                 Entire file
NEXT n              Next n records
RECORD n            Specific record
REST                Current record through EOF
FOR expr            Conditional processing
WHILE expr          Continue while true
FIELDS f1,f2,...    Restrict fields shown/used

General pattern:

COMMAND [ALL|NEXT n|RECORD n|REST]
        [FOR expr]
        [WHILE expr]
        [FIELDS field-list]


